 [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"b05b4fea4a73780cce64560b265c07159ec96aca7568252770853522a734134e","event_uuid":"03a3f629-93f5-46d6-aa06-2018018e4b87","position":{"commit_sha":"4cb8e864edfcbadadbe92e13c621d7e4b6b02b5e","position":"1788370737909525075-03a3f629-93f5-46d6-aa06-2018018e4b87"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"53bfdf658fa819f194696711a1b55ed39d876ceda8027154a87ff0b19eacfbda","event_uuid":"c9a7ecff-f651-4d6b-8438-2f9b2fb8225e","position":{"commit_sha":"aad8b36845e9b3c8fbbe8110841291ba5f7136ce","position":"1788370750037145302-c9a7ecff-f651-4d6b-8438-2f9b2fb8225e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"ae1864be914a046f4ee1bf8e18e7db7acfdd7efe07dc705a3c9d36b0503c578b","event_uuid":"ca5651f5-baf0-45ce-9d83-00a641b44fda","position":{"commit_sha":"bd107806be1cf77005dcbad9eaad39a58abb22a6","position":"1788370785747788914-ca5651f5-baf0-45ce-9d83-00a641b44fda"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"1954b410de9e6c8086231959a07dc637333d8d8154b1b5e3a9210143da909e0b","event_uuid":"1c1f04f4-c808-41e3-9a65-077176828856","position":{"commit_sha":"88333dfcd8d2090671c3d7f68b6d6f5716a19ce5","position":"1788371019469202978-1c1f04f4-c808-41e3-9a65-077176828856"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Phase 1 RCA / debug dossier\n\nStep 0(a): searched `PowerShell ParserError setup-uv checksum asset expectedHash actualHash` and open/in_progress bugs; only this ticket matched.\nStep 0(b): report text names main commit 5ff99170b5d0cf97f2f639f117f4b9337622ba33 as the failing build floor. Suspect paths changed afterward in 024a6a2278134128be0c76c8d7c60e41b4ba817d (`Fix setup-uv PowerShell checksum parsing`).\nStep 0(c): investigation worktree is current at 952f0825321c755f41edce412ad1fe9f1db9268d = origin/main.\n\nProven root cause: `.github/actions/setup-uv/action.yml` as introduced by 5ff99170b5d0cf97f2f639f117f4b9337622ba33 contained `throw \"Checksum mismatch for $asset: expected $expectedHash, got $actualHash\"` in the embedded `pwsh` block (original action line 70). In a PowerShell double-quoted string, `$asset:` is parsed as a scoped/drive-qualified variable token rather than variable `$asset` followed by literal `:`, so the script fails during parsing before any install/test command can run. Legitimate scoped references such as `$env:RUNNER_OS`, `$env:RUNNER_ARCH`, `$env:GITHUB_PATH`, and `$env:GITHUB_OUTPUT` are not defects.\n\nProof: failing CI run 33574990286 at 5ff99170 shows Linux lint setup log `ParserError ... .ps1:51` pointing exactly at `$asset:` in the checksum-mismatch throw. The current action has `throw \"Checksum mismatch for ${asset}: expected $expectedHash, got $actualHash\"`; grep/static scan of `.github/actions/setup-uv/action.yml` finds no non-scope `$name:` hazards remaining. No local `pwsh` executable is installed, so OS execution proof comes from CI: Gerrit Verify run 33575422978 passed all setup-dependent jobs; main Test Suite (mirror) run 33578307020 reached `make lint`/`make typecheck` on Linux, pytest on macOS, and pytest on Windows after `Successfully installed uv 0.12.7` (Windows later failed in unrelated test collection, not action parsing). Later main Test Suite runs 33601203013 and 33632384491 are green.\n\nDefect origin: attributed to ticket 5caa-4b63-7ea2-4e71 via introducing commit 5ff99170b5d0cf97f2f639f117f4b9337622ba33, which added the repo-local setup-uv action and the offending checksum throw. I recorded the caused_by edge after attaching the introducing commit to 5caa because the MCP link gate did not see the commit reference; no force was used.\n\nPhase 2 plan/fix already landed in Gerrit change 2501: brace the asset interpolation as `${asset}:`, extend `scripts/check_uv_pin.py` with a portable static guard for non-scope `$name:` in the local action, and add regression coverage in `tests/unit/test_uv_pin_guard.py`. File impact recorded on this ticket for those three paths.","timestamp":1788370785747788914}],"commits":[{"sha":"024a6a2278134128be0c76c8d7c60e41b4ba817d"}],"created_at":1788369441115962001,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6df98990-a901-463f-9583-b016f5220a7f","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"b2dc-b1ab-0bd9-47f6"},{"link_uuid":"d7942c65-bd79-4f44-9d73-ddefbc2f2021","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"5caa-4b63-7ea2-4e71"},{"link_uuid":"9917645a-c5a0-43d8-ae52-4c2ee60aa5c7","provenance":"explicit","relation":"caused_by","target_id":"5caa-4b63-7ea2-4e71"}],"description":"## Observed signal\nError sweep window 2026-09-01T11:58:00-07:00..2026-09-02T10:00:00-07:00 (2026-09-01T18:58:00Z..2026-09-02T17:00:00Z) found GitHub Actions jobs failing before tests in the repository-local `.github/actions/setup-uv` action.\n\nPrimary main signal: Test Suite (mirror) run 33574990286, workflow_dispatch on `main` at commit 5ff99170b5d0cf97f2f639f117f4b9337622ba33 (`Install uv through local setup action`, rebar-ticket 5caa), failed across setup-dependent matrix legs within seconds.\n\nRepresentative error from multiple Linux/macOS/Windows legs:\n\n`ParserError: ... line 51 | throw \"Checksum mismatch for $asset: expected $expectedHash, got $actualHash\"`\n\nPowerShell parses `$asset:` as an invalid variable reference in a double-quoted string. The failure appears before lint/tests/audit/mutation can run. The same signature also appears on Dependabot PR/push runs 33575277400, 33575284677, 33575277452, and 33575284612.\n\n## Root-cause direction\nThe newly repository-local setup action is implemented in PowerShell and interpolates `$asset:` directly inside a double-quoted string. It should delimit the variable, e.g. `${asset}:`, or otherwise avoid the colon-adjacent variable parse. Because the action is used by the suite, prompt eval, mutation, lint/typecheck, and audit jobs, the parse error is a gate-wide setup failure.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- `.github/actions/setup-uv` no longer emits a PowerShell parser error for the checksum-mismatch branch on Linux, macOS, or Windows runners.\n- A Test Suite (mirror) run on main reaches the intended lint/test/audit/mutation commands instead of failing inside setup-uv action parsing.\n- Prompt Eval jobs that use the same setup action also pass setup or fail only in their intended evaluation command, not action parsing.\n- Add or update coverage/static validation so `$name:` interpolation in PowerShell action scripts is caught before CI.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":".github/actions/setup-uv/action.yml","reason":"Brace colon-adjacent PowerShell asset interpolation so composite action parses on all runners."},{"path":"scripts/check_uv_pin.py","reason":"Static uv-pin guard rejects non-scope $name: PowerShell interpolation hazards in the local action."},{"path":"tests/unit/test_uv_pin_guard.py","reason":"Regression coverage proves the uv-pin guard catches the PowerShell $name: parser hazard."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","managed_refs":[["relates_to","5caa-4b63-7ea2-4e71"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"e253e9fb-3320-4371-b814-20f970dd8fa4","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"fab8-3a2b-d966-4e63","ticket_type":"bug","title":"[ci] Local setup-uv action PowerShell parser error breaks every job before tests","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b98f6a60-9ee3-4d27-87f5-6ec8e77b6099","6df98990-a901-463f-9583-b016f5220a7f","d7942c65-bd79-4f44-9d73-ddefbc2f2021","e253e9fb-3320-4371-b814-20f970dd8fa4","3aa446c3-1f36-4abe-83ff-b39fbf0fe60c","9917645a-c5a0-43d8-ae52-4c2ee60aa5c7","03a3f629-93f5-46d6-aa06-2018018e4b87","c9a7ecff-f651-4d6b-8438-2f9b2fb8225e","ca5651f5-baf0-45ce-9d83-00a641b44fda","1c1f04f4-c808-41e3-9a65-077176828856"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788371019469202979,"uuid":"1d6683b8-deba-4a90-8c16-7bdba754e5e2"}